+| walk_stalk F36 | +0.540 mm | +2.254 mm | 0.000472 mm | n/a | 787.082× | 65.884× |
+| lunge_thrust F40 | +0.531 mm | +2.066 mm | 0.000965 mm | n/a | 1,141.381× | 73.787× |
