Iteration 02 is complete and **not published**.

The new source fixes I01’s rest-pose defects: complete arms and shoulders, no floating hair debris, continuous trim, and clean sash/plate layering. However:

- 24-bone coverage fails for RightForeArm, RightHand, Head, and head_end.
- All five moves show severe strip deformation.
- I02 p99 edge stretch is 48×–74× versus I01’s 21×–27×.

Build, GLB round-trip, grip, floor clearance, and blade collision checks otherwise pass. The canonical character remains unchanged, no publish backups were created, and no `.blend`/`.glb` files were copied to the Mac.

Key deliverables:

- [Final report](/Users/aaron_7nh0yzm/godwyn-boss-fight/renders/astra/char2/MESHY_BODY_I02_REPORT.md)
- [God A comparison](/Users/aaron_7nh0yzm/godwyn-boss-fight/renders/astra/char2/meshy_body_i02_comparison.png)
- [I01/I02 comparison](/Users/aaron_7nh0yzm/godwyn-boss-fight/renders/astra/char2/meshy_body_i02_vs_i01_comparison.png)
- [Move audit](/Users/aaron_7nh0yzm/godwyn-boss-fight/renders/astra/rehost_body_i02/meshy_body_moves_audit.json)
- [Stretch comparison](/Users/aaron_7nh0yzm/godwyn-boss-fight/renders/astra/rehost_body_i02/meshy_body_i02_stretch_comparison.json)
- [Rising Spin film](/Users/aaron_7nh0yzm/godwyn-boss-fight/renders/astra/rehost_body_i02/rising_spin.mp4)
- [X-slash film](/Users/aaron_7nh0yzm/godwyn-boss-fight/renders/astra/rehost_body_i02/xslash.mp4)

The candidate and five move `.blend` files remain on black-sky only. No git commit or push was made.
